content.text:
help me update some of the git skills in my plugin. I'm focusing on commit, commit and pr, and resolve feedback skills right now.

Commit generally is too long and verbose. Really I just want nicely created commit messages that follow the conventional commit standard and describe changes made.&#x20;

commit and pr seems to duplicate a lot of commit skill, and again is far too long. Also doesn't really produce good decriptions in the pr body, I think [$sisber:pr-description](/Users/staggart/.codex/plugins/cache/sesco/sisber/0.2.0/skills/pr-description/SKILL.md) does a better job.&#x20;

Lastly I want to change the resolve pr feedback to just be a follow on from the triage pr feedback. all it is responsible for is making sure the code we agreed upon in triage was pushed and each comment resolved correctly. triage does the work

